# Finder's per-directory sidecar. macOS rewrites it whenever a folder is
# opened, so a tracked one is a permanently dirty working tree and a stream
# of commits about icon positions.
.DS_Store

# Claude Code's local config. The permission allowlist accumulates the literal
# commands approved in a session, so it is a record of what was run on this
# machine and by whom — machine-specific, useless to a clone, and not the
# repository's business. Ignored as a directory rather than a filename so a
# settings.json or a CLAUDE.md appearing later is covered too.
.claude/
